    "checkout": "bf4075b0a2e8092b04b726c59a7b085d5a37e6f6",
    "note": "phoneDSH S4b authority delta: routine creator and confirmation, Task authorization subset, CreateTeammate author. No dsh-bot upstream vector exists for these host-only envelopes."
  },
  "upstream": [],
  "delta": [
    "a routine records its creator as the turn source (rpcId/turnId) plus whether a user message authorized it",
    "creating a routine or widening it (more frequent schedule, interrupt delivery, urgent, resume) needs a user turn or an approvalID",
    "a Task carries an explicit authorization subset: allowed write directories, network write, task delegation",
    "allowed_write_directories resolve against the Bot workspace root and decide canWriteOutsideWorkspace",
    "CreateTeammate records the authoring turn and approval in the created-Bot audit"
  ],
